.com/ZazaGdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":126429727,"digest":"sha256:354f6c948aea3ec774869ca82a305bbfd84f816ad21f578b049878feff67df41","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-10T23:20:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T23:20:57Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/download/v0.4.1/Doodlebay-Setup-0.4.1.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/tarball/v0.4.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/zipball/v0.4.1","body":"- **New branding:** Doodlebay has a new logo, a whiteboard on legs with a squiggle and an orange marker. You see it on the app window, the taskbar, the Start menu, the desktop shortcut and the installer.\n- Nothing else changes in this release.\n\n**Install:** download `Doodlebay-Setup-0.4.1.exe` and run it. It installs over 0.4.0 and keeps your folders, settings, library, versions and Trash. The installer is not code-signed, so Windows SmartScreen shows \"Windows protected your PC\": click **More info**, then **Run anyway**.\n\nDoodlebay is built on the open-source Excalidraw editor and is not made by or connected to the Excalidraw team.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/406019462","assets_url":"https://api.git