. Every version from the last day is kept, then one a day for 30 days.\n- **Trash:** right-click a drawing in the sidebar and choose **Delete** to move it to the **Trash** at the bottom of the sidebar. Restore it where it was, or delete it for good. The Trash empties itself after 30 days.\n\nSearch, version history and the Trash all stay on your PC. Versions and deleted drawings are kept in Doodlebay's own data folder, never next to your drawings.\n\n**Install:** download `Doodlebay-Setup-0.3.0.exe` and run it. It installs over 0.2.x and keeps your folders, settings and library. The installer is not code-signed, so Windows SmartScreen shows \"Windows protected your PC\": click **More info**, then **Run anyway**.\n\nDoodlebay is built on the open-source Excalidraw editor and is not made by or connected to the Excalidraw team.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/403889730","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/403889730/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/403889730/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/tag/v0.2.1","id":403889730,"author":{"login":"ZazaGdev","id":75507663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NTA3NjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75507663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev","html_url":"https://github.com/ZazaGdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/events{/privacy