tps://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/zipball/v0.2.1","body":"- The library's pulsing \"+\" button is gone. To add a selection to your library, right-click it and choose **Add to library**.\n- An empty library now shows a **Browse libraries** button at the top, so it's easy to get started.\n\n**Install:** download `Doodlebay-Setup-0.2.1.exe` and run it. It installs over 0.2.0 and keeps your folders, settings and library. The installer is not code-signed, so Windows SmartScreen shows \"Windows protected your PC\": click **More info**, then **Run anyway**.\n\nDoodlebay is built on the open-source Excalidraw editor and is not made by or connected to the Excalidraw team.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/403867712","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/403867712/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/403867712/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/tag/v0.2.0","id":403867712,"author":{"login":"ZazaGdev","id":75507663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NTA3NjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75507663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev","html_url":"https://github.com/ZazaGdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOU8yamc4YEohA","tag_name":"v0.2.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"Doodlebay 0.2.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-05T15:30:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T15:29:30Z","published_at":"2026-10-05T15:29:30Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/assets/612945332","id":612945332,"node_id":"RA_kwDOU8yamc4kiM20","name":"Doodlebay-Setup-0.2.0.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"ZazaGdev","id":75507663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NTA3NjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75507663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev","html_url":"https://github.com/ZazaGdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZazaGdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":126395305,"digest":"sha256:39d4720b9fd2f606e82d1f029fec28bfd7d3685b0d03f53e4cf162c750083aa9","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-05T15:29:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T15:29:29Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/releases/download/v0.2.0/Doodlebay-Setup-0.2.0.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/tarball/v0.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZazaGdev/Doodlebay/zipball/v0.2.0","body":"ExcaliDesk is now **Doodlebay**. Same app, new name, nothing else lost.\n\n- Installing Doodlebay removes ExcaliDesk 0.1.0 if it is installed, and takes over opening `.excalidraw` files.\n- On first start Doodlebay brings over ExcaliDesk's attached folders, theme, always-on-top setting, library and Drafts. Your drawings stay where they are.\n- The `.excalidraw` file type now shows as \"Drawing (.excalidraw)\" in Explorer.\n\nEverything from 0.1.0 is still here: the full Excalidraw editor offline, folder sidebar with autosave, blank canvas that saves as Untitled 1, 2, 3..., double-click to open from Explorer, foldable library sections, always-on-top pin.\n\n**Install:** download `Doodlebay-Setup-0.2.0.exe` and run it. The installer is not code-signed, so Windows SmartScreen shows \"Windows protected your PC\": click **More info**, then **Run anyway**.\n\nDoodlebay is built on the open-source Excalidraw editor and is not made by or connected to the Excalidraw team.\n"}]